  id: v60-japanese-iced
  brewer: v60
  brewerName: V60
  label: Japanese Iced
  legacyVariant: japanese-iced
  size: "02"
  min: 12
  max: 30
  dose: 15
  grind: Encore · 13
  texture: A starting point, two clicks finer than the hot V60 suggestion. Adjust to your beans and grinder calibration.
  temperature: 201–205°F
  temperatureF: 203
  order: 20
---

= Prep =
Rinse the filter and discard the rinse water before adding @ice{75%g} to the carafe. Assemble the #V60{} with @coffee{15%g}, then tare the scale. Pour targets exclude the ice.

= Bloom =
Wet all the grounds with @water{30%g} over ~scaled{10%seconds}, then give the brewer a gentle swirl.

= Let it bloom =
Let the coffee release its gas. No water needed. Wait until ~until{30%seconds} on the brew clock.

= Pour 1 =
Pour @water{60%g} over ~scaled{20%seconds} in slow circles, from the center outward. Avoid the filter walls.

= Let it settle =
Give the water time to drain through the bed for ~{10%seconds}.

= Pour 2 =
Pour @water{60%g} over ~scaled{20%seconds} in slow circles, from the center outward. Avoid the filter walls.

= Draw down =
Gently swirl to level the bed. Let the remaining water drain for ~{70%seconds}.

= Finish =
Remove the brewer, swirl to chill, then top with ice to taste. Extra serving ice is not included in the recipe ratio.
